OL,3,GNEWSARushden fans celebrate league
OL,4,Aopposition in FA Cup
OL,5,
OL,6,FFans and players of eighth-tier AFC
OL,7,FRushden & Diamonds have been
OL,8,Fcelebrating after being drawn an away
OL,9,Ftie at League One's Burton Albion in
OL,10,Fthe FA Cup.
OL,12,FIt is the first time the Northern
OL,13,FPremier League Division One Midlands
OL,14,Fside, founded in 2011 following the
OL,15,Fdemise of Rushden & Diamonds, have
OL,16,Freached the tournament's first round.
OL,18,FSurrounded by about 200 people gathered
OL,19,Fat the Northamptonshire club for the
OL,20,Fdraw, chairman Rob Usher said: "Let's
OL,21,Fgo put Diamonds back on the map."
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
